# A10: keep secrets, local state and evaluator-only material out of every
# Docker build context (images are built from the repo root).
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.data
var
# Lane B: evaluator answers and generated full datasets never enter an image
# (lane-b.md contract question 12). The compact fixture (api/ + dev_only/) is
# needed ONLY in the web image's discarded build stage, where the
# production-bundle guard reads it to prove no fixture value leaked into
# dist/; the final web image contains dist/ only, and the API/worker images
# copy explicit source directories only.
tests
data/generator/out
docs
